{"title":"2019 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 10B Problems\">2019 AMC 10B #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2019 AMC 12B Problems\">2019 AMC 12B #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution(Comprehensive🧠)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution(Comprehensive🧠)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Alicia had two containers. The first was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/0/970ffc67a479e2152f649737fb6fa0acc4bb961f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" /> full of water and the second was empty. She poured all the water from the first container into the second container, at which point the second container was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/8/dd8646894f09910d68bdc1aabc0d22bb3e643194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"9\" height=\"21\" /> full of water. What is the ratio of the volume of the first container to the volume of the second container?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/301c18f9b0e3c7f2476ee0a5700ab34a94afd191.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } \\frac{5}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(B) } \\frac{4}{5} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) } \\frac{7}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(D) } \\frac{9}{10} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) } \\frac{11}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"390\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the first jar's volume be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and the second's be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. It is given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/b/80b267bdccaf9fdc1c3743940dd0550a257a8e38.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{5}{6}A=\\frac{3}{4}B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />. We find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/5/1b5e4482a80aecaa4ffc5c715082b7bc8f3cc4e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{A}{B}=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{3}{4}\\right)}{\\left(\\frac{5}{6}\\right)}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{9}{10}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"171\" height=\"49\" /> \n</p><p>We already know that this is the ratio of the smaller to the larger volume because it is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/d/6cdd1b53e5faf7a118222e4b7571d1e9afa0cf56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>An alternate solution is to substitute an arbitrary maximum volume for the first container - let's say <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/d/94db15b430439ad5b3c80bfacfef0c6499ede2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" />, so there was a volume of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> in the first container, and then the second container also has a volume of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/a/13a499dd5928b9dcf25936a0445549382c1527e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60 \\cdot \\frac{4}{3} = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"86\" height=\"37\" />. Thus the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/0/c400217dc713742daad1682772b748e7fac49258.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{72}{80} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }\\frac{9}{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"116\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p><p>~IronicNinja\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fGpUnH4sUc4\">https://youtu.be/fGpUnH4sUc4</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution.28Comprehensive.F0.9F.A7.A0.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution(Comprehensive🧠)\">Video Solution(Comprehensive🧠)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution(Comprehensive🧠)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/fpWabhDOvoY\">https://youtu.be/fpWabhDOvoY</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width: